{"id":"sperva","lemma":"сперва","pos":"adv","rank":1254,"glosses":["first, firstly","at first, originally"],"audio":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/transcoded/3/31/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B2%D0%B0.ogg/Ru-%D1%81%D0%BF%D0%B5%D1%80%D0%B2%D0%B0.ogg.mp3","examples":[{"text":"Я хотел сперва показать тебе.","en":"I wanted to show you first.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},null,{"g":"to show"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"}]},{"text":"Я должен сперва закончить эту работу.","en":"I must finish this work first.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"must, have to"},null,{"g":"to finish, to end"},null,null]},{"text":"Я её сперва не узнал.","en":"I couldn't recognize her at first.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"her"},null,{"g":"not"},{"g":"to recognize","l":"узнать"}]},{"text":"Сперва мне нужно выпить.","en":"I need a drink first.","words":[null,{"g":"(to) me","l":"я"},{"g":"it is necessary"},{"g":"to drink, to drink up"}]},{"text":"Я хочу сперва кое-что тебе показать.","en":"I want to show you something first.","words":[{"g":"I"},{"g":"to want, to desire","l":"хотеть"},null,null,{"g":"what / that"},{"g":"(to) you","l":"ты"},{"g":"to show"}]}]}